  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/827259ae-c6fa-4175-a5f7-b02ca0b7c0a0-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 223px;\" /><br /><br />Let equation of tangent be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />Now, its points of intersection with co-ordinate axis are&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>cos&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>sin&#945;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ar</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>PAB</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ar</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>PAO</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>OP</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>32</mn></math><br /><br />which is maximum if,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
